    "description": "- Worked on a Native Win32 app (Post Test Explorer) using C++ 14 and Python; the app is tailored specifically for flight test engineers to analyze post flight data.\n- Set up a publishing system where users can share their work with other clients within their network.\n- Created a version control hub for user python files and reports. Some features of this include: check-in, check-out, rollback, view history, diff, etc.\n- Contributed to an in-house Python IDE, made for the ease of use for flight test engineers to code custom functions to manipulate their data.\n- Worked on a word processor written in Python using PyQt5. Built multiple plots, template functionality, and several more features for creating flight analysis reports.\n- Added the ability to persist all user data using a custom built JSON library written in C++.\n- Created C++ widgets from scratch with GDI+ for our personal library.",
